+- BLAS DGEMM：https://netlib.org/lapack/explore-html/dd/d09/group__gemm_ga1e899f8453bcbfde78e91a86a2dab984.html
+- C++ Core Guidelines F.20：https://isocpp.github.io/CppCoreGuidelines/CppCoreGuidelines#Rf-out
+- NVIDIA FMA：https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/floating-point/index.html
+- NVIDIA 2:4：https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/accelerating-inference-with-sparsity-using-ampere-and-tensorrt/
+- AMD MI350：https://rocmdocs.amd.com/en/latest/reference/gpu-arch/mi350.html
+- 华为 4:2：https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/82RC1/opdevg/Ascendcopdevg/atlas_ascendc_10_10021.html
+- Intel Sparse BLAS：https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/docs/onemkl/developer-reference-dpcpp/2026-0/overview-of-intel-oneapi-math-kernel-library.html
+- Apple Sparse Solvers：https://developer.apple.com/documentation/accelerate/sparse-solvers-library
+- PyTorch 梯度清零：https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/recipes/recipes/zeroing_out_gradients.html
